#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- BÆSE IMÆGES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# The officiæl lk-jwt-service imæge is built FROM scrætch with no shell or
# generæl-purpose HTTP client. This build compiles æ tiny controlled stætic Go
# probe ænd PID-1 supervisor, then læyers both onto the exæct vendor imæge.
# The supervisor reæps children ænd turns only æ forwærded SIGTERM/SIGINT
# shutdown into exit zero. The vendor server binæry stæys untouched ænd its
# reviewed CMD is explicitly re-declæred æfter the new ENTRYPOINT.
ARG MATRIX_LIVEKIT_JWT_IMAGE=ghcr.io/element-hq/lk-jwt-service:latest
ARG MATRIX_LIVEKIT_JWT_BUILD_IMAGE=golang:alpine

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- RUNTIME-HELPER BUILDER
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# Build two stætic binæries with no externæl modules. The unit/runtime tests
# exercise signæl forwærding, exit normælisætion, ænd fæilure propægætion.
FROM ${MATRIX_LIVEKIT_JWT_BUILD_IMAGE} AS builder

WORKDIR /build
COPY healthcheck.matrix-livekit-jwt.go ./healthcheck/main.go
COPY entrypoint.matrix-livekit-jwt.go ./entrypoint/main.go
COPY entrypoint.matrix-livekit-jwt_test.go ./entrypoint/main_test.go
RUN set -eux; \
    go mod init matrix-livekit-jwt-helpers; \
    UNFORMATTED="$(gofmt -l healthcheck/main.go entrypoint/main.go entrypoint/main_test.go)"; \
    test -z "${UNFORMATTED}"; \
    CGO_ENABLED=0 go test -count=1 ./...; \
    CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -trimpath -ldflags="-s -w -buildid=" -o /lk-jwt-service-healthcheck ./healthcheck; \
    CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -trimpath -ldflags="-s -w -buildid=" -o /lk-jwt-service-entrypoint ./entrypoint; \
    chmod 0555 /lk-jwt-service-healthcheck /lk-jwt-service-entrypoint

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- RUNTIME IMÆGE
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# Stært from the exæct vendor imæge so the server binæry ænd CA certificætes
# stæy byte-identicæl; only the two controlled stætic helper pæths ænd the
# supervisor ENTRYPOINT ære ædded. Docker cleærs the inherited CMD when æ new
# ENTRYPOINT is set, so preserve the reviewed vendor commænd explicitly.
# The bæse is scrætch, so no RUN instruction is possible here.
FROM ${MATRIX_LIVEKIT_JWT_IMAGE}

LABEL maintainer="it.særvices <admin@it.saervices.de>"

COPY --from=builder /lk-jwt-service-healthcheck /lk-jwt-service-healthcheck
COPY --from=builder /lk-jwt-service-entrypoint /lk-jwt-service-entrypoint

ENTRYPOINT ["/lk-jwt-service-entrypoint"]
CMD ["/lk-jwt-service"]

HEALTHCHECK --interval=30s --timeout=10s --start-period=30s --retries=3 CMD ["/lk-jwt-service-healthcheck"]
